---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro'
import Prose from '~/components/Prose.astro'

// The privacy policy on Google's consent screen. Keep it in step with what
// convex/schema.ts stores.
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What Tian stores, and where">
  <Prose>
    <h1>Privacy in Tian</h1>
    <p>
      Tian is a set of games for learning Mandarin, made by Gorm Rødder for
      family and friends. It has no advertising, no tracking and no analytics.
    </p>

    <h2>Without signing in</h2>
    <p>
      Your word bank, scores and settings are kept only in the browser on the
      device you use. None of it is sent to us.
    </p>

    <h2>When you sign in with Google</h2>
    <p>We then store:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        your name, email address and profile picture from Google, to know who
        is signed in;
      </li>
      <li>
        whether you are a member, and your request for access with the message
        you may have written;
      </li>
      <li>
        as a member, your word bank: the words you have met, your scores and
        progress.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We use this only to give access and to show you your progress on the
      devices where you are signed in. Gorm sees the names and email addresses
      of those who ask for access or are members. We share nothing with anyone
      and use it for nothing else.
    </p>

    <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
    <p>
      With <a href="https://www.convex.dev">Convex</a>, which runs the
      database for us on servers in Northern Virginia, USA. The sign-in itself
      goes through Google. The page loads its fonts from Google Fonts and the
      stroke order of characters from jsDelivr, which, like any website, see
      your IP address.
    </p>

    <h2>Deletion</h2>
    <p>
      If you want your account and everything that belongs to it deleted,
      write to <a href="mailto:gorm@ymse.land">gorm@ymse.land</a>, and we will
      delete it.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:gorm@ymse.land">gorm@ymse.land</a>.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/about">About Tian</a></p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
